<title>USA: Great Southern Bancorp Q1 Sept 30 net off.</title>
<headline>Great Southern Bancorp Q1 Sept 30 net off.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Mo. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.11		    $0.62</p>
<p> Net			    493		    2,885</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Current Q1 earnings reduced by $2.6 million or $0.58/shr in after-tax charges. The charges were offset in part by $372,000 or $0.08/shr in after-tax gains from sale of foreclosed assets held for sale and available-for-sale securities. The charges include a $1.5 million SAIF Fund assessment and $1.1 million goodwill writeoff.</p>
<p>Assets $657.7 million vs $643.7 million</p>
<p>Deposits $382.5 million vs $384.8 million</p>
<p>Loans $552.8 million vs $526.7 million</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
